---
import PolicyLayout from '../layouts/PolicyLayout.astro';
import { siteConfig } from '../data/site';
---

<PolicyLayout
  title="Returns & Refunds"
  description="Learn how to return or exchange a perfume from LUMÈRA LUXE in Qatar and when you can get a refund."
  intro="Learn how to return or exchange a perfume and what to do if it arrives damaged. Qatar Law No. 8 of 2008 protects your rights as a customer."
  links={[
    { id: 'returns-guarantee', label: '6-hour returns' },
    { id: 'damaged-or-faulty', label: 'Damaged items' },
    { id: 'how-to-return', label: 'How to return' },
    { id: 'refunds', label: 'Refunds' }
  ]}
  contact={{
    title: "Start a return",
    text: "Message us to request a return or exchange.",
    message: "Hello LUMÈRA LUXE, I would like to request an exchange or return.",
    label: "Start a return on WhatsApp"
  }}
>
  <section id="returns-guarantee">
    <h2>6-hour return guarantee</h2>
    <p>
      We accept return and exchange requests within six hours of delivery.
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>Ask for a return or exchange within <strong>six hours</strong> of delivery.</li>
      <li>You can return or exchange the perfume even if you’ve opened and used it.</li>
      <li>Return the bottle, box, and cap in good condition. They must be undamaged and free of tampering.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      <em>Message us on WhatsApp at +974 6667 5166 with your order details. Our courier will arrange to pick up the perfume from your door. Please note that we do not provide separate scent trial vials or samples.</em>
    </p>
  </section>

  <section id="damaged-or-faulty">
    <h2>Damaged or faulty perfume</h2>
    <p>
      We check and pack each bottle by hand before delivery. If your bottle arrives damaged, leaks, or has a faulty spray nozzle, follow these steps.
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>Message us on WhatsApp within <strong>24 hours</strong> of delivery. Send clear photos of the outer packaging and the bottle.</li>
      <li>Our courier will pick up the bottle for free.</li>
      <li>Once we confirm the damage or fault, you can choose an immediate replacement or a full refund.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section id="how-to-return">
    <h2>How to return a perfume</h2>
    <ol>
      <li>
        <strong>Send a message.</strong> Message us on WhatsApp at <a href={`https://wa.me/${siteConfig.whatsappNumber}`} class="policy-link">{siteConfig.whatsappDisplay}</a> with the name on your order and photos of the bottle, box, and batch code.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Arrange pickup.</strong> Once we approve your return, we’ll arrange for a courier to pick up the perfume at your door.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>We check your return.</strong> We check the bottle and packaging within 24 hours of pickup.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Get your refund.</strong> We issue approved refunds right away. We refund cash payments at pickup and electronic payments by bank transfer.
      </li>
    </ol>
  </section>

  <section id="refunds">
    <h2>What your refund covers</h2>
    <p>
      If we approve your refund, you get back the full price you paid for the perfume. If you return it because you don’t like it, your refund excludes any delivery fee you paid. If we send a faulty or incorrect item, we refund all charges, including delivery.
    </p>
  </section>
</PolicyLayout>
